**Definition 75.1 (common installation and three distinct tasks).** Sections 76–81 use the original native rational-field installation of §§17–18,34,55–66. Finite ordered terms have grammar $u::=\alpha\mid\beta\mid\langle u,u\rangle$, with root address $\varepsilon$ and ordered child suffixes $L,R$. Such a term belongs to $\mathcal D$ when none of its logical alpha leaves has an address ending in $L$. Its materialization $C(u)$ has one cell at an alpha, a root and left terminal marker at a beta, and a root joined to the two ordered subtrees at a pair. Material markers are not logical growth targets. Write $A_u$ for the symmetric, zero-diagonal, unit adjacency on its actual material cells. The actual field is rational. Tick applies $A_u$ and returns ACK only; a separate terminal Read returns the entire literal rational. Add is terminal translation, and Hold prevents unrequested evolution during local computation.

At a logical alpha $p$, $P_p$ replaces that alpha by beta, retains every old cell, value and edge, appends zero at $pL$, and moves the acted raw label there. At a logical beta $p$, $S_p$ replaces that beta by $\langle\beta,\alpha\rangle$, retains $p,pL$ and all old values and edges, appends zero at $pLL,pR$, moves the acted label to $pLL$, and assigns the next raw integer to $pR$. Raw labels are translated through the actual exhaustive raw/canonical table; an ordinal in a formula is not a new source port.

The original complete interface is retained. Absent address, branch target and wrong leaf type have their distinct identity refusals. Integer Add/Read outside the roster gives RangeRefusal. A complete malformed frame, including the former Reset tag, gives BadFrame and changes nothing. A proper incomplete frame remains pending with its actual bytes and parser state, without a completed action or reply. Missing rights disable dispatch. They are not numerical refusals. Each executed call consumes its whole reply, End, local acknowledgement and Return; retained state is synchronized before the next settled cut.

An authentic original-root binding, orientation, exact law and framing, current/fresh grants, exclusive serialization, exact arithmetic and sufficient actual finite backing are installation premises. No numerical timing, capacity, allocation-name, guard or provider side channel is allowed. Physical conformance and isolation of dependent records are **ASSUMED-UNVERIFIED** premises of these ideal installations. View inversion does not certify them.

The three tasks below have different entrances. Section 76 receives the cleared binary family of §56 and permits actual adaptive growth. Sections 77–78 start with the arbitrary attachment of §34 and execute its marking before acquiring and physically restoring the original field. Sections 79–80 receive an already earned graph and cleared receiver records at an arbitrary field, and restrict acquisition Reads at two available terminals. Neither entrance nor success standard is substituted for another.

